;; tags: mem-ops, pair
;; expect: 3
;; Adjacent 64-bit slots in a stack array. The x86 backend emits two
;; independent MOVs; on AArch64 the peephole optimizer (or the prologue
;; emitter, in phase 05) is allowed to fold the consecutive 8-byte
;; stores into a single STP Xs, Xt, [Xn] (and likewise LDP for the
;; reads). Either codegen must produce a + b == 1 + 2 == 3.
(defun main ()
  (let ((buf (new 'stack-no-clear 'array int64 2)))
    (set! (-> buf 0) 1)
    (set! (-> buf 1) 2)
    (let ((a (-> buf 0))
          (b (-> buf 1)))
      (format #t "~D~%" (+ a b)))))
